{
  "id": "study04-upper-expression",
  "title": "Study04上半部分：内容与表达探索",
  "document": true,
  "revision": 4,
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "research-opening",
      "title": "研究问题与上半部分的任务",
      "mode": "content",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "research-opening-current",
          "label": "当前内容",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "central-question",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p><strong>小样本条件下，不同三参数Weibull估计方法表现出怎样的性能差异，这些差异如何受到样本量与参数条件的共同影响？</strong></p><p>上半部分先回答：目前有哪些方法，为什么形成这么多方法，怎样通过分类与沿袭等关系将它们归拢，再确定几种代表方法进入统一比较。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "scope",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>以下沿用“分类 → 沿袭与关联 → 共同困难 → 七种实现定位”的内容顺序。既有内容直接阅读和批注；图示形式仍未定的地方，放出不同表达供比较。</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "principle-classification",
      "title": "1　按估计依据归拢方法",
      "mode": "content",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "principle-classification-current",
          "label": "当前内容",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "classification-meaning",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>方法名称中混合着估计准则、修正步骤和计算工具。分类先看<strong>依据什么确定参数</strong>，方法关系再说明它改变或借用了哪个环节。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "seven-principles",
              "kind": "visual",
              "html": "<table><tr><th>估计依据</th><th>怎样确定参数</th><th>例子</th></tr><tr><td>似然与修正估计方程</td><td>联合密度或修改后的得分关系</td><td>MLE、CH-MMLE、WMLE、K–R、LSPF／LPF</td></tr><tr><td>概率区间</td><td>相邻观测／分组边界的CDF增量</td><td>MPS、QML／QMP</td></tr><tr><td>分布关系与拟合</td><td>概率图、CDF、密度或伪尺度的偏离</td><td>White／Soman、Park、MDM</td></tr><tr><td>矩与统计关系</td><td>匹配或反演理论统计关系</td><td>Cran、PWM、L／TL矩、W均值匹配</td></tr><tr><td>线性最小方差</td><td>在给定条件与估计类中确定组合权重</td><td>条件MVLUE及扩展</td></tr><tr><td>后验推断</td><td>先验与似然合成后验，按指定规则估计</td><td>Bayes</td></tr><tr><td>直接学习</td><td>训练样本／特征到参数的映射</td><td>ANN／BPNN</td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview-form",
      "title": "总览图怎样同时承载分类和关系？",
      "mode": "choices",
      "inline": true,
      "context": "两种组织都保留七条主干；区别在于沿袭关系是放进总图，还是在讲述时局部放大。",
      "selected": "overview-form-integrated",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "overview-form-integrated",
          "label": "把关系放进一张综合图",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "integrated-meaning",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p><mark>分类与承接放在同一视野</mark>，直接看到每类中如何发展；信息密度较高，需要沿线讲述。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "integrated-figure",
              "kind": "image",
              "src": "assets/01-map-integrated.svg",
              "alt": "把关系放进一张综合图"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "overview-form-layered",
          "label": "分类总览，再放大局部关系",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "layered-meaning",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>总览先归拢名称；<mark>每讲一组改动，再展开原理和沿袭</mark>。听众一次接收的关系较少，但需要在总览和局部之间切换。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "layered-figure",
              "kind": "image",
              "src": "assets/02-map-layered.svg",
              "alt": "分类总览，再放大局部关系"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "likelihood-content",
      "title": "2　先认识MLE的内核与原型流程",
      "mode": "content",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "likelihood-content-current",
          "label": "当前内容",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "likelihood-core",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>给定同一份样本，先尝试一组候选参数 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span>。这组参数规定了一条密度曲线，每个观测在曲线上对应一个密度值。MLE将这些值相乘得到似然，或取对数相加得到 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span>，据此比较候选参数。</p><p>为了求解，可以从似然导出得分关系，并结合参数域与边界条件寻找候选解。先讲清这一套<strong>样本 → 密度 → 似然 → 求解关系 → 参数输出</strong>，后续改动才有明确的参照物。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "likelihood-prototype-image",
              "kind": "image",
              "src": "assets/09-mle-prototype.svg",
              "alt": "MLE内核与原型流程：在观测处计算密度，汇总对数似然，再形成求解关系"
            },
            {
              "id": "likelihood-evidence",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>图中的三个候选只用于解释似然怎样构成，不代表已经求得最优参数。原始三参数似然的无界路径、有限局部解与数值失败仍需区分；本轮先把统计内核讲清，求解器细节不展开。</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "state": "modify"
    },
    {
      "id": "likelihood-form",
      "title": "回到同一个原型：后续方法究竟改动哪里？",
      "mode": "content",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "likelihood-form-components",
          "label": "原型流程上的局部改动",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "components-meaning",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>保持上面的MLE原型流程，再逐处标出改动：Cohen–Whitten替换位置方向的关系；WMLE改变求解关系并校准尺度恢复；Smith／K–R先定位并删除最小观测，改变进入估计的数据。DMMLE再把数据修改与Firth型修正组合起来。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "components-figure",
              "kind": "image",
              "src": "assets/机制图/似然方法-原型与改动.svg",
              "alt": "可编辑draw.io机制图：在同一MLE原型中直接展示删最小值、位置关系替换、权重嵌入和得分组合"
            },
            {
              "id": "likelihood-patch-provenance",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>历史来源单独接回这些改动：Jacquelin→Cousineau WMLE；Smith→Kundu–Raqab；K–R＋Firth→DMMLE。图中“插入哪里”说明构造，箭头是否表示沿袭仍由原文证据决定。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "components-editable-source",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p><a href=\"assets/机制图/似然方法-原型与改动.drawio\">可编辑的draw.io源图</a> · <a href=\"assets/机制图/似然方法-原型与改动.pdf\">PDF图稿</a></p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "state": "modify"
    },
    {
      "id": "interval-mechanism",
      "title": "概率区间：把密度项改成怎样的概率量？",
      "mode": "content",
      "state": "modify",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "interval-mechanism-current",
          "label": "当前机制表达",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "interval-meaning",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>MLE用观测处的密度，MPS用相邻观测之间的CDF增量，QMP还保留分组计数，CMLE则只改最小观测处的一项。MPS含两端区间，约定首尾CDF边界为0与1；区间切分方式和计数条件满足时，才得到其作为QMP特例的关系。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "interval-figure",
              "kind": "image",
              "src": "assets/机制图/概率区间-MPS与分组.svg",
              "alt": "概率区间机制图：点密度与区间概率的对照，MPS、QMP和CMLE分别改变哪些量"
            },
            {
              "id": "interval-figure-source",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p><a href=\"assets/机制图/概率区间-MPS与分组.drawio\">可编辑的draw.io源图</a> · <a href=\"assets/机制图/概率区间-MPS与分组.pdf\">PDF图稿</a></p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "regression-content",
      "title": "3　概率图方法：相同分布关系中的不同选择",
      "mode": "content",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "regression-content-current",
          "label": "当前内容",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "regression-shared",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>给定候选位置后，令 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span>，概率图关系是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span>。具体方法还取决于<strong>分数怎样取、位置怎样定、沿哪个方向回归、参数怎样恢复</strong>。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "regression-relations",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>White→Soman是二参数回归向未知位置的扩展；Park沿相关性定位思路构造方法，2018年补充条件下的存在性论证。Yang迭代法借用LSPF的位置修正，再接回概率图回归。Soman与Park之间暂不画历史继承箭头。</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "regression-form",
      "title": "沿同一个概率图原型，定位、方向与更新怎样改变？",
      "mode": "content",
      "state": "modify",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "regression-form-sequence",
          "label": "当前机制表达",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "sequence-meaning",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>先呈现概率图共同骨架，再直接画出位置平移、两种残差方向与位置修正迭代。各分支的分数和参数恢复保留区别；这张图用于理解构造，不用一条箭头代替所有历史关系。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "sequence-figure",
              "kind": "image",
              "src": "assets/机制图/概率图-原型与改动.svg",
              "alt": "概率图机制图：位置改变点列、回归方向改变残差、Yang借用位置修正再迭代"
            },
            {
              "id": "sequence-figure-source",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p><a href=\"assets/机制图/概率图-原型与改动.drawio\">可编辑的draw.io源图</a> · <a href=\"assets/机制图/概率图-原型与改动.pdf\">PDF图稿</a></p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mdm-content",
      "title": "分布拟合中的另一种判据：MDM",
      "mode": "content",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "mdm-content-current",
          "label": "当前内容",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "mdm-meaning",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>给定形状与位置，每个观测都能反推出尺度伪估计：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></semantics></math></span>。MDM比较这一束尺度值的离散程度，而概率图回归比较直线拟合关系。</p><p>当前MDM-0.1先在固定γ下求条件形状，使伪尺度标准差最小，再按条件最小标准差曲线的梯度达到δ=0.1定位，尺度取伪估计均值。它与直接对β、γ联合最小化标准差不同。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "mdm-mechanism",
              "kind": "image",
              "src": "assets/机制图/MDM-伪尺度与条件定位.svg",
              "alt": "MDM机制图：同一分布关系反推尺度伪估计，条件求形状、按梯度定位置，再恢复尺度"
            },
            {
              "id": "mdm-mechanism-source",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p><a href=\"assets/机制图/MDM-伪尺度与条件定位.drawio\">可编辑的draw.io源图</a> · <a href=\"assets/机制图/MDM-伪尺度与条件定位.pdf\">PDF图稿</a></p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "statistics-content",
      "title": "4　矩与统计量：共享材料，可以采用不同准则",
      "mode": "content",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "statistics-content-current",
          "label": "当前内容",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "moment-shared",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>Cran式MM把寿命间隔按不同权重加总，得到1、2、4阶Weibull矩，再显式恢复参数。形状关系为 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mn>4</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span>。矩差之比接近1时，恢复分母会接近零。</p><p>Cran的Weibull矩与PWM有总体泛函联系，PWM与L矩有条件下的线性转换，L矩到TL矩则是减少端部影响的推广。数学联系与历史承接分别表示。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "invariance-shared",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span>消去位置和尺度；2003年的方法匹配W均值，2013 LSPF则利用W的联合密度。2015 LPF改用 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></semantics></math></span>，只消去位置、保留尺度。2003与2013共享构造，直接历史承接未确认；LSPF→LPF有作者明示改进证据。</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "statistics-form",
      "title": "同一个匹配骨架：怎样汇总，又怎样改变统计关系？",
      "mode": "content",
      "state": "modify",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "statistics-form-operations",
          "label": "当前机制表达",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "operations-meaning",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>先画样本统计量与理论关系匹配的原型，再看Cran的生存阶梯幂次、PWM到L矩的线性重组，以及TL矩对概念次序量的调整。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "operations-figure",
              "kind": "image",
              "src": "assets/机制图/矩方法-加权汇总与变体.svg",
              "alt": "矩方法机制图：生存阶梯的幂次积分、PWM与L矩线性重组、TL矩内部次序量"
            },
            {
              "id": "operations-figure-source",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p><a href=\"assets/机制图/矩方法-加权汇总与变体.drawio\">可编辑的draw.io源图</a> · <a href=\"assets/机制图/矩方法-加权汇总与变体.pdf\">PDF图稿</a></p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "invariance-mechanism",
      "title": "W与V：先看消去什么，再看用什么准则估计",
      "mode": "content",
      "state": "modify",
      "selected": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "invariance-mechanism-current",
          "label": "当前机制表达",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "invariance-meaning",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p>同一批寿命可以先去位置，再去尺度；得到的统计量还可以接到均值匹配或联合密度。LSPF到LPF的改动，具体体现在少除去一个尺度量；寿命间距与CDF概率间距也在图中分开。</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "invariance-figure",
              "kind": "image",
              "src": "assets/机制图/不变统计量-W与V.svg",
